---
import Base from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<Base
  title={`Classic Kenya Safari | 8 Day Itinerary (Mara, Amboseli & Nakuru) | Rendile Travels`}
  description={`An 8 day Classic Kenya Safari for women, the Maasai Mara, Amboseli beneath Kilimanjaro and the flamingo lakes of the Rift Valley. Day by day itinerary, what's included and prices from $7,900.`}
  ogTitle={`Classic Kenya Safari | 8 Day Itinerary | Rendile Travels`}
  ogDescription={`Maasai Mara, Amboseli & Lake Nakuru in 8 days, tailor made for women. Day by day itinerary from $7,900.`}
  ogType={`website`}
  ogImage={`assets/img/kenya-amboseli.jpg`}
  canonical={`https://rendiletravels.com/classic-kenya-safari.html`}
  keywords={`Classic Kenya safari, 8 day Kenya itinerary, Maasai Mara Amboseli Lake Nakuru safari, women luxury safari Kenya`}
  jsonld={`{
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "TouristTrip",
    "name": "Classic Kenya Safari — 8-Day Itinerary",
    "description": "An 8-day women's luxury safari through Kenya's Maasai Mara, Amboseli and Lake Nakuru.",
    "image": "https://rendiletravels.com/assets/img/kenya-amboseli.jpg",
    "touristType": "Women's luxury safari",
    "provider": {"@type": "Organization", "name": "Rendile Travels"},
    "offers": {"@type": "Offer", "price": "7900", "priceCurrency": "USD"}
  }`}
>

<!-- Hero -->
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="page-hero__media" style="background-image:url('assets/img/kenya-amboseli.jpg')"></div>
    <div class="page-hero__scrim"></div>
    <div class="container page-hero__content">
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--light reveal">Kenya · Itinerary</p>
      <h1 class="reveal">Classic Kenya Safari</h1>
      <div class="itin-meta reveal">
        <span><b>8 days</b></span>
        <span>Mara · Amboseli · Nakuru</span>
        <span>Private &amp; tailor made</span>
        <span>from <b>$7,900</b> / person</span>
      </div>
      <div class="hero__actions reveal" style="margin-top:1.6rem">
        <a href="contact.html?trip=Classic%20Kenya%20Safari" class="btn btn--gold">Enquire about this trip</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Day by day -->
  <section class="section section--cream">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section__head reveal">
        <p class="eyebrow">Day by day</p>
        <h2 class="section__title">Your 8 day journey</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="days">
        <div class="day reveal">
          <div class="day__img" style="background-image:url('assets/img/kenya-nairobi.jpg')"></div>
          <div class="day__num">Day 1</div>
          <div class="day__body">
            <h3>Welcome to Nairobi</h3>
            <p>Met on arrival and whisked to a gracious city hotel to rest. Time to settle in, with an optional visit to the Sheldrick elephant orphanage or Giraffe Centre.</p>
            <p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Hand picked Nairobi hotel · <b>Meals:</b> Dinner</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="day reveal">
          <div class="day__img" style="background-image:url('assets/img/kenya-cheetah.jpg')"></div>
          <div class="day__num">Day 2</div>
          <div class="day__body">
            <h3>Fly to the Maasai Mara</h3>
            <p>A short, scenic flight over the Rift Valley to the Mara. Settle into camp, then head out on an afternoon game drive as the light turns gold.</p>
            <p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Luxury tented camp · <b>Meals:</b> All</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="day reveal">
          <div class="day__img" style="background-image:url('assets/img/kenya-migration.jpg')"></div>
          <div class="day__num">Day 3</div>
          <div class="day__body">
            <h3>Maasai Mara, full day</h3>
            <p>A full day in big cat country: lion prides, cheetah on the plains, and (in season) the Great Migration. Add a dawn hot air balloon flight with bush breakfast, or a visit to a Maasai community.</p>
            <p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Luxury tented camp · <b>Meals:</b> All</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="day reveal">
          <div class="day__img" style="background-image:url('assets/img/kenya-amboseli.jpg')"></div>
          <div class="day__num">Day 4</div>
          <div class="day__body">
            <h3>To Amboseli</h3>
            <p>Fly via Nairobi to Amboseli, in the shadow of Mount Kilimanjaro. An afternoon drive among the park's famous elephant herds.</p>
            <p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Amboseli lodge or camp · <b>Meals:</b> All</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="day reveal">
          <div class="day__img" style="background-image:url('assets/img/kenya-giraffe.jpg')"></div>
          <div class="day__num">Day 5</div>
          <div class="day__body">
            <h3>Amboseli &amp; Kilimanjaro</h3>
            <p>Dawn and dusk drives with Africa's highest peak as your backdrop, elephants, big skies, and some of the continent's most photographed views.</p>
            <p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Amboseli lodge or camp · <b>Meals:</b> All</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="day reveal">
          <div class="day__img" style="background-image:url('assets/img/kenya-nakuru.jpg')"></div>
          <div class="day__num">Day 6</div>
          <div class="day__body">
            <h3>Into the Rift Valley, Lake Nakuru</h3>
            <p>Travel to the Great Rift Valley and Lake Nakuru National Park, famous for flamingo pink shorelines and both black and white rhino.</p>
            <p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Rift Valley lodge · <b>Meals:</b> All</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="day reveal">
          <div class="day__img" style="background-image:url('assets/img/kenya-nakuru.jpg')"></div>
          <div class="day__num">Day 7</div>
          <div class="day__body">
            <h3>Lake Nakuru &amp; the Rift</h3>
            <p>A morning game drive, then time to slow down, a lakeside lunch, a spa moment, or a viewpoint over the valley before your final night.</p>
            <p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Rift Valley lodge · <b>Meals:</b> All</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="day reveal">
          <div class="day__img" style="background-image:url('assets/img/kenya-nairobi.jpg')"></div>
          <div class="day__num">Day 8</div>
          <div class="day__body">
            <h3>Return to Nairobi &amp; farewell</h3>
            <p>An easy return to Nairobi for your onward flight, or continue to Zanzibar or the Kenyan coast for a few barefoot days by the sea.</p>
            <p class="day__stay"><b>Meals:</b> Breakfast</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Camps & Lodges -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section__head reveal">
        <p class="eyebrow">Where you'll stay</p>
        <h2 class="section__title">Camps &amp; lodges</h2>
        <p class="section__intro">Hand picked, women friendly stays, the kinds of places we'll book for you on this journey.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feat__grid">
        <a class="feat reveal" href="contact.html?trip=Classic%20Kenya%20Safari"><div class="feat__img" style="background-image:url('assets/img/kenya-nairobi.jpg')"></div><div class="feat__body"><h3>Giraffe Manor, Nairobi</h3><p>Breakfast with giraffes at Kenya's most storied address.</p><span class="feat__more">View stay →</span></div></a>
        <a class="feat reveal" href="contact.html?trip=Classic%20Kenya%20Safari"><div class="feat__img" style="background-image:url('assets/img/lodge-tent.jpg')"></div><div class="feat__body"><h3>Mahali Mzuri, Maasai Mara</h3><p>Ultra luxe tented suites high above the Mara.</p><span class="feat__more">View stay →</span></div></a>
        <a class="feat reveal" href="contact.html?trip=Classic%20Kenya%20Safari"><div class="feat__img" style="background-image:url('assets/img/lodge-suite.jpg')"></div><div class="feat__body"><h3>Angama Amboseli</h3><p>Design led suites with Kilimanjaro framed from your bed.</p><span class="feat__more">View stay →</span></div></a>
        <a class="feat reveal" href="contact.html?trip=Classic%20Kenya%20Safari"><div class="feat__img" style="background-image:url('assets/img/lodge-view.jpg')"></div><div class="feat__body"><h3>The Cliff, Lake Nakuru</h3><p>An infinity pool and sweeping Rift Valley views.</p><span class="feat__more">View stay →</span></div></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Price per person -->
  <section class="section section--cream">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section__head section__head--left reveal">
        <p class="eyebrow">Dates &amp; rates</p>
        <h2 class="section__title">Price per person</h2>
        <p class="section__intro">Land arrangements, per person sharing (2026).</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rates reveal">
        <table>
          <thead>
            <tr><th>&nbsp;</th><th>Nov, Jan to May</th><th>June to October</th><th>December</th></tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr><td>Double occupancy</td><td>$7,900</td><td>$9,200</td><td>$9,600</td></tr>
            <tr><td>Single supplement</td><td>$1,650</td><td>$2,100</td><td>$2,200</td></tr>
            <tr><td>Internal flights*</td><td>$980</td><td>$1,150</td><td>$1,150</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      <p class="rates__note reveal">* Nairobi / Maasai Mara / Amboseli / Lake Nakuru / Nairobi, connections may apply. International flights and visas are not included. Ask us about a private vehicle for your Classic Kenya Safari.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- What's included -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="incl reveal">
        <div class="section__head section__head--left">
          <p class="eyebrow">All taken care of</p>
          <h2 class="section__title">What's included</h2>
        </div>
        <ul class="incl__grid">
          <li>All internal flights &amp; private transfers</li>
          <li>Hand picked camps &amp; lodges</li>
          <li>All meals as shown</li>
          <li>Private guide &amp; game drives</li>
          <li>All park &amp; conservancy fees</li>
          <li>Female guides where possible</li>
          <li>24/7 Rendile concierge</li>
          <li>Bottled water &amp; refreshments</li>
          <li>All gratuities to guides &amp; staff</li>
          <li>Personal travel designer, start to finish</li>
        </ul>
        <p style="margin-top:1.2rem;color:var(--ink-soft)">International flights and visas are not included. Prices from <strong>$7,900 per person sharing</strong>; single travellers and women only departures are warmly welcome. Departures year round, the Great Migration peaks July to October.</p>
        <div class="incl__cta reveal">
          <a href="contact.html?trip=Classic%20Kenya%20Safari" class="btn btn--gold">Enquire about this trip</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Footer -->

</Base>
